==English==

===Etymology===
From the saying that no one ever sees a dead donkey, hence a rarity. This then became a stock example of a slow-news day story, which was popularized by the title of the British [[sitcom]] ''Drop the Dead Donkey''. ''see'' [[Wikipedia:Drop the Dead Donkey|Wikipedia entry]].

